      "text": "字幕製作：測試樣本組"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "ts": "00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,200",
      "type": "merged",
      "cueKind": "dialogue",
      "method": "exact-match",
      "timingSource": "primary",
      "primaryCue": 2,
      "secondaryCue": 1,
      "groupId": null,
      "text": "你今天怎麼這麼早就起來了\nWhy are you up so early today?"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "ts": "00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,000",
      "type": "merged",
      "cueKind": "dialogue",
      "method": "exact-match",
      "timingSource": "primary",
      "primaryCue": 3,
      "secondaryCue": 2,
      "groupId": null,
      "text": "我睡不著 乾脆起來煮點咖啡\nI couldn't sleep,\nso I figured I'd make some coffee."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "ts": "00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:12,800",
      "type": "merged",
      "cueKind": "dialogue",
      "method": "exact-match",
      "timingSource": "primary",
      "primaryCue": 4,
      "secondaryCue": 3,
      "groupId": null,
      "text": "你要不要也來一杯 我煮了一大壺 夠我們兩個人喝一整個上午\nDo you want a cup too? I made a big pot,\nenough for both of us to drink all morning."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "ts": "00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000",
      "type": "merged",
      "cueKind": "dialogue",
      "method": "exact-match",
      "timingSource": "primary",
      "primaryCue": 5,
      "secondaryCue": 4,
      "groupId": null,
      "text": "- 好啊 - 加不加糖\n- Sure.\n- Sugar?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "ts": "00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,500",
      "type": "merged",
      "cueKind": "dialogue",
      "method": "exact-match",
      "timingSource": "primary",
      "primaryCue": 6,
      "secondaryCue": 5,
      "groupId": null,
      "text": "樓下那家店的手機殼打八折 我昨天順手買了一個\nThe shop downstairs has phone cases at 20% off,\nso I grabbed one yesterday."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "ts": "00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000",
      "type": "merged",
      "cueKind": "dialogue",
      "method": "exact-match",
      "timingSource": "primary",
      "primaryCue": 7,
      "secondaryCue": 6,
      "groupId": null,
      "text": "一共是128.50元 比網上便宜了差不多30塊\nIt came to 128.50 in total,\nabout 30 cheaper than online."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "ts": "00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:33,200",
      "type": "merged",
      "cueKind": "dialogue",
      "method": "coverage-merge",
      "timingSource": "secondary",
      "primaryCue": 8,
      "secondaryCue": 7,
      "groupId": "cover-8-7-8",
      "text": "其實我一直想跟你說 下個月我可能要搬到離公司近一點的地方去住\nThere's something I've been meaning to tell you."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "ts": "00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:35,100",
      "type": "merged",
      "cueKind": "dialogue",
      "method": "coverage-merge",
      "timingSource": "secondary",
      "primaryCue": 8,
      "secondaryCue": 8,
      "groupId": "cover-8-7-8",
      "text": "其實我一直想跟你說 下個月我可能要搬到離公司近一點的地方去住\nI might move closer to work next month."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "ts": "00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:37,000",
      "type": "merged",
      "cueKind": "dialogue",
      "method": "exact-match",
      "timingSource": "primary",
      "primaryCue": 9,
      "secondaryCue": 9,
      "groupId": null,
      "text": "真的嗎\nReally?"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "ts": "00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:40,000",
      "type": "merged",
      "cueKind": "dialogue",
      "method": "exact-match",
      "timingSource": "primary",
      "primaryCue": 10,
      "secondaryCue": 10,
      "groupId": null,
      "text": "嗯 每天通勤兩個小時 實在是太累了\nYeah. Two hours of commuting every day\nis just too much."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "ts": "00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:43,600",
      "type": "lyrics",
      "cueKind": "lyrics",
      "method": "single-track",
      "timingSource": "secondary",
      "primaryCue": null,
      "secondaryCue": 11,
      "groupId": null,
      "text": "♪ The rain keeps falling outside ♪"
    }
  ],
